[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "ruy-main 7.Bb3"]
[Name "7...d6: the main line by another order"]

7... d6 { Guards e5 before castling. With ...d6 played, the Marshall's ...d5 would cost Black a move. }
8. c3 { With no Marshall to worry about, c3 can come at once. }
8... O-O
9. h3 { Stops ...Bg4. This is the main line again, with c3 and h3 played in the other order. [%cal Gh3g4] } *
